properties.property:
[
  {
    "text": "'Why hello dearie, its your Auntie Blyte! Say, heard of tokens? Powerful items in their own special slot? Capitols charge a fortune for them, but I have some unique and very strong ones for no gold at all! They just cost a few slivers of your soul, no big deal really. You'd look great with a bit less soul anyway. Fitter. Sleeker. Sexier. So, why take some for a spin?!'",
    "options": [
      {
        "name": "This sounds like a bad idea.",
        "text": "'But the bad ideas are the most fun! I'll be here if you decide to play things less safe.'",
        "options": [
          {
            "name": "(Continue)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Tell me about what you're offering.",
        "text": "'Of course, darling! I have a 1/1 devil token that deals 1 damage to anything when it dies, a 1/1 changeling that's every creature type, a munitions artifact token that deals 2 damage to anything when it goes to the graveyard, and my ultimate token - a 1/1 ninja that can't be blocked!'",
        "options": [
          {
            "name": "Alright, what about prices.",
            "text": "'I think you'll find them a steal!'",
            "options": [
              {
                "name": "I'll take the devil token! (PAY 4 MAX LIFE.)",
                "text": "'Excellent choice! Just between us, that one's my favorite! But then, I'm a bit biased.'",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "name": "(Continue)",
                    "action": [
                      {
                        "grantRewards": [
                          {
                            "type": "life",
                            "count": -4
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "item",
                            "count": 1,
                            "itemName": "Token of the Devil"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "name": "I'll take the changeling token! (PAY 3 MAX LIFE.)",
                "text": "'Excellent choice! Versatile and useful for any deck! I hear they can really do ANYTHING if you know what I mean...'",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "name": "(Continue)",
                    "action": [
                      {
                        "grantRewards": [
                          {
                            "type": "life",
                            "count": -3
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "item",
                            "count": 1,
                            "itemName": "Token of Change"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "name": "I'll take the munitions token! (PAY 2 MAX LIFE.)",
                "text": "'Excellent choice! Nothing like blowing things up to improve your day!'",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "name": "(Continue)",
                    "action": [
                      {
                        "grantRewards": [
                          {
                            "type": "life",
                            "count": -2
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "item",
                            "count": 1,
                            "itemName": "Token of Munitions"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "name": "I'll take the Ninja token! (PAY 6 MAX LIFE.)",
                "text": "'Excellent choice! I respect you going for the most opulent and expensive! Nothing beats the power of money!'",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "name": "(Continue)",
                    "action": [
                      {
                        "grantRewards": [
                          {
                            "type": "life",
                            "count": -6
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "item",
                            "count": 1,
                            "itemName": "Token of Ninjutsu"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "name": "I think I'll pass.",
                "text": "'Perhaps some other time, hmm darling? I'll be waiting with tea when you get back!'",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "name": "(Continue)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
  ]

[
{
   "text": "Muttering and shaded eyes glance about in this cave. To your left, someone selling stolen goods. To your right, a tiny winged devil holds a cup of tea and gives you an inviting smile. Ahead, you can see some gold glimmering unguarded - might have to rob the robbers...",
   "options": [{
      "name": "(Continue)", "action": [{"deleteMapObject":-1}]}]
}
]

[
{
   "text": "A shaded figure calls out from the stall ahead. 

'I got what you need to succeed in the cutthroat world out there. Unique items for the cunning rogue. Cash only, no refunds.'",
   "options": [{
      "name": "(Continue)", "action": [{"deleteMapObject":-1}]}]
}
]

